<closer><dateline><hi rendition="#fr">Datum Schwerin, den 4ten                                             September 1812.</hi></dateline>                                     <lb/>
<signed><hi rendition="#fr"><hi rendition="#c"><hi rendition="#aq">(L. S.)<lb/>
Ad Mandatum                                                   Sereni&#x017F;&#x017F;imi                                                 proprium.</hi></hi><lb/>
